{"product_id":"caiden-gloves","title":"Caiden Gloves","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCaiden Gloves\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e are high-performance billiard gloves designed to provide smooth cue movement, comfortable hand positioning, and consistent bridge-hand control. Built with performance fabrics and ergonomic construction, Caiden offers multiple glove designs to match the individual preferences and playing styles of today's players.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe gloves feature \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltra Slick Fabric\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for a smooth, low-friction surface, while \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHyper Cool technology\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps maintain comfort during extended sessions. Each model offers a different balance of coverage, ventilation, and direct hand contact, allowing players to choose the feel that best complements their stroke.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltra Slick Fabric\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for smooth cue movement\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHyper Cool technology\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for enhanced cooling and comfort\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eErgonomic, close-fitting construction\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLightweight and flexible design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned to reduce friction between the bridge hand and cue shaft\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAnti-slip palm features for added stability\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in different finger configurations\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for consistent bridge-hand movement and stroke control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable Models\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eClassic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Full-finger design with an anti-slip silicone logo on the palm. Ideal for players who prefer maximum coverage and a smooth, traditional glove feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eComfort\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Hybrid open-finger design with the thumb and index finger covered while the middle finger remains open. Features thinner fabric, ProCool Mesh, and a non-slip suede palm pad for improved ventilation and enhanced feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eContact\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Open-finger design with all fingers exposed, providing maximum finger freedom and a more direct connection with the cue.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerformance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltra Slick Feel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Promotes smooth and effortless cue movement\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHyper Cool Comfort\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain comfort during extended playing sessions\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eErgonomic Fit\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Follows the natural movement of the hand\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFlexible Options\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Multiple designs allow players to choose their preferred level of coverage and hand contact\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStable Bridge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Anti-slip palm features provide additional stability during the stroke\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlayers looking for a performance-oriented billiard glove that combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003esmooth cue movement, cooling comfort, flexibility, and reliable bridge-hand control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, with Classic, Comfort, and Contact designs to suit different playing preferences.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSmooth movement. Cool comfort. Total control. Caiden Gloves are built to keep your stroke effortless.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 🎱\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43487173509168,"sku":null,"price":2200.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/c895c7a9-de2d-4804-85cc-0f38c950215d.png?v=1786679524","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/products\/caiden-gloves","provider":"Cues Master Shop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}